# Unity .gitignore Template
# Source: https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Unity.gitignore
# Last synced: 2026-07-02
# License: CC0-1.0
#
# This template is maintained from the github/gitignore repository
# and distributed under Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal license.

# This .gitignore file should be placed at the root of your Unity project directory
#
# Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Unity.gitignore
#
# Recommended: add any editor/OS/tool-specific ignore rules from the Global/ templates as needed.
# See: https://github.com/github/gitignore/tree/main/Global
#
.utmp/
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
*.log

# By default unity supports Blender asset imports, *.blend1 blender files do not need to be commited to version control.
*.blend1
*.blend1.meta

# MemoryCaptures can get excessive in size.
# They also could contain extremely sensitive data
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/

# Recordings can get excessive in size
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Uncomment this line if you wish to ignore the asset store tools plugin
# /[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*

# Autogenerated Jetbrains Rider plugin
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
# Jetbrains Rider personal-layer settings
*.DotSettings.user

# Visual Studio cache directory
.vs/

# Gradle cache directory
.gradle/

# Autogenerated VS/MD/Consulo solution and project files
ExportedObj/
.consulo/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# Unity3D generated meta files
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# Unity3D generated file on crash reports
sysinfo.txt

# Mono auto generated files
mono_crash.*

# Builds
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
*.app

# Crashlytics generated file
crashlytics-build.properties

# TestRunner generated files
InitTestScene*.unity*

# Addressables default ignores, before user customizations
/ServerData
/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/aa*
/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/link.xml*
/[Aa]ssets/Addressables_Temp*
# By default, Addressables content builds will generate addressables_content_state.bin
# files in platform-specific subfolders, for example:
# /Assets/AddressableAssetsData/OSX/addressables_content_state.bin
/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*

# Visual Scripting auto-generated files
/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db
/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db.meta
/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers
/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers.meta

# Auto-generated scenes by play mode tests
/[Aa]ssets/[Ii]nit[Tt]est[Ss]cene*.unity*

# Auto-generated cache in Assets folder
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]ceneDependencyCache*

# Unity Version Control workspace metadata (UVCS runs in tandem with git)
/.plastic/
# Licensed packs and Asset Store tools: OUT of git wherever they sit in the tree (they moved twice on 2 Nov).
# ithappy agreement, Asset Store EULA, Feel and Shapes licences all forbid redistribution; UVCS carries them.
**/ithappy/
**/ithappy.meta
**/_Imports/
**/_Imports.meta
**/Feel/
**/Feel.meta
**/Shapes/
**/Shapes.meta
**/FastScriptReload/
**/FastScriptReload.meta
/Packages/dev.ameye.linework-lite/
# VFX packs added 14 Nov (Asset Store EULA: no redistribution)
**/Polygon Arsenal/
**/Polygon Arsenal.meta
**/Magic Pig Games (Infinity PBR)/
**/Magic Pig Games (Infinity PBR).meta
**/Synty/
**/Synty.meta
**/Unluck Software/
**/Unluck Software.meta
**/Ash Assets/
**/Ash Assets.meta
**/ERP/
**/ERP.meta
**/ShaderGraph_Dissolve/
**/ShaderGraph_Dissolve.meta

# headless stills, regenerated by CourseBuilder.Stills
docs/stills/
Logs/

# Build Mode catalogue: generated from the licensed packs (renders of their models) - rebuilt by Shift Jam > Workshop > Build Catalog
**/_Game/Art/Thumbs/
**/_Game/Art/Thumbs.meta
**/_Game/Resources/BuildCatalog.asset
**/_Game/Resources/BuildCatalog.asset.meta

# the play log's detail files and note stills, one set per play (PlayLog.cs); the rows are in docs/PLAYLOG.md
/Playtests/
# Packs added 19-20 Nov (Asset Store EULA / their own licences: no redistribution; LLMUnity can hold model files)
**/ARTnGAME/
**/ARTnGAME.meta
**/Amazing Assets/
**/Amazing Assets.meta
**/Animation Workbench/
**/Animation Workbench.meta
/Assets/Gizmos/
/Assets/Gizmos.meta
**/LLMUnity/
**/LLMUnity.meta
**/MudBun/
**/MudBun.meta
/Assets/Plugins/
/Assets/Plugins.meta
**/Procedural Worlds/
**/Procedural Worlds.meta
**/SnowStarGames/
**/SnowStarGames.meta
**/Tiny Giant Studio/
**/Tiny Giant Studio.meta
# Coming in: Staggart (Spline Mesher Pro, Stylized Water 3) and Distant Lands (COZY)
**/Staggart Creations/
**/Staggart Creations.meta
**/StylizedWater3/
**/StylizedWater3.meta
**/Stylized Water 3/
**/Stylized Water 3.meta
**/Distant Lands/
**/Distant Lands.meta
# Packs added 25 Nov (Asset Store EULA: no redistribution). DOTween Pro and Grabbit 2 sit under /Assets/Plugins/ (above).
**/Artificer/
**/Artificer.meta
**/AssetInventory/
**/AssetInventory.meta
**/KINEMATION/
**/KINEMATION.meta
**/MagicaCloth2/
**/MagicaCloth2.meta
# Grabbit 2's baked collision shapes (D-0232): made from the licensed toy meshes, so they stay out of the public repo
/Assets/Grabbit Baked Colliders/
/Assets/Grabbit Baked Colliders.meta
# Embedded Asset Store packages (no redistribution)
/Packages/com.febucci.text-animator-unity/
/Packages/com.heath.lattice/
/Packages/com.jbooth.microsplat.core/
/Packages/xyz.staggart-creations.splinemesher-pro/
/Packages/com.staggart.*/
/Packages/xyz.staggart-creations.*/
/Packages/com.distantlands.*/
# LLMUnity downloads its runtime libraries here (3.9 GB on 20 Nov)
/Assets/StreamingAssets/LlamaLib*
/Assets/StreamingAssets/LlamaLib*.meta
# Plugin-made files (DOTween setup writes its settings here; the StreamingAssets folder stub comes with LLMUnity)
/Assets/Resources/DOTweenSettings.asset
/Assets/Resources/DOTweenSettings.asset.meta
/Assets/Resources.meta
/Assets/StreamingAssets.meta
